{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2023-05-04 15:30:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS TO SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS FOR IRON AND STEELMAKING OPERATIONS AT AISTECH2023', 'text': 'AIR PRODUCTS FOUNDATION WILL DONATE UP TO $15,000 TO THE AIST FOUNDATION LEHIGH VALLEY, PA. , MAY 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE:APD) WILL SHOWCASE INDUSTRIAL GAS SOLUTIONS AND TECHNOLOGIES FOR ALL PHASES OF IRON AND STEEL PRODUCTION AT AISTECH2023, THE ANNUAL CONFERENCE FOR THE ASSOCIATION FOR IRON & STEEL TECHNOLOGY, BEING HELD FROM MAY 8-10 AT HUNTINGTON PLACE, IN DETROIT, MICHIGAN.'}